<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">Yihuda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yihuda Xaafezi Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yihuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yih.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yihuda Xaafeez Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Yihuda kiitay xaafintteezay, ammanekkazar ammaniza asii aazii worddo timirtte zeriz asitaypp kiristtaanitay naaginttod garkk akaakisodayis. Yha haata kiitay fa gancce aykkeez qofay nam7intho Phixiroosa kiitana aaziza. Xaafay, «Ammaniza asis Xoossii lammamayis pettii toke inggintteez ammanossi miinggii olinttoytta» yeegii nabbabizita miinthii qofisiza.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yihuda kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Sarotho <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Worddo asitamaaritay timirttennee u fokith <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:3-16">3-16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammano naagod garkk inggintteez zore <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:17-23">17-23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galata woosa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">24-25</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1"/>Ta Yihuda, Yesuus Kiristtoosa ayllay, Yayqqooba ishay;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Xooss xeegeezitayis, Xooss Aday dosizitayissinnee Yesuus Kiristtoosar naaginttezitayis yha dabddaabba yinttis xaafiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mat. 13:55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mar. 6:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2"/>Maarotithi, sarotithinnee siiqo yinttis kumo.<verse eid="JUD 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Worddo asitamaarita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3"/>Ta siiqo ishitayyo, nu pettipp wolla shaginttiza faxotithay bagga yinttis xaafodayis ta iita amotteeza Zin ammaniza asayis lammamayis pettii toke inggintteez ammanayis olinttoday garkk yinttan zorttar xaafodayis taas koshshiza baz maaqqeeza. <verse eid="JUD 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4"/>U pirdday binipp xaafinttii betteez pettii pettii asitay ookka erekkazin yi gancce zurqinttii geleeza. Unttii Xooss eroozita, u nu Xoossay aadho keehetitha gase udii ganccer tuna baz udiza. Fa aaddas kaatinnee Goda maaqqeez, Yesuusa Kiristtoosa kaddiza.<verse eid="JUD 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5"/>Yha ubba pettii toke eriza baz maaqqikokka, Goday Isreele asa Gibxxe biittapp wayizii kesseezako, ma guyepp ammanoozita dhabiseeza ta yinttan akaakisodayis koyiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:51">Kes. 12:51</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:29-30">Tay. 14:29-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6"/>Fa yezabessa ashshii, paasi inggintteez mawuta naagekka kiitanchchita, gita pirdde gallas hellodayis Xoossay unttan dhuma gancce medhinas santhalaater accii gaddeeza. <verse eid="JUD 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7"/>Yey garkk, Soodomannee Gamoora asitaynnee u lanqqe yez katamitayid yez asitay lagiteeza; lagitar wolla tuna beezoowa baz ootheeza. Unttii medhinas tama gancce seerinttizitayis aaziso maaqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-24">Medhe. 19:1-24</ref></char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8"/>Yey garkkekka, yha elimotizitay fa asha tuniseeza; mawuter yez adita leqqiza; salo yez bonchintteez medhetithitakka cazhiza. <verse eid="JUD 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9"/>Kiitanchchitay halaqa Mika7eelekka Muse ahayis Daabuloosar palameez gallas «Goday nena seero» yeegeezapp attin ezal afa cazhzhodayis koyekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">Daan. 10:13</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:7">Wan. Qon. 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 34:6">Nam7i. 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:2">Zak. 3:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10"/>Zin yha asitay paas eroowa baz ubba cazhiza; ma unttii wozina baa mehe garkk medhetithayir erikokka, iza unttan dhabisoda. <verse eid="JUD 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11"/>Unttan ayye! U Qaa7eela oge yhanigeeza. Miishe koyii Balaama garkk buuta gancce wodhdheeza. Qore Xoossal afa denddeezay garkk u Xoossal denddii dhabeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">Medhe. 4:3-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 22:1-35">Tay. 22:1-35</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">16:1-35</ref></char></note><verse eid="JUD 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12"/>Yha asay, yeella bayth yi siiqo imato miiz aqo yinttar maadayis bettii qayixinttiza laafita. U fabaz adas qoppizita. U carkko garkkennee ira baa shaara garkke. Ma aafiz wode aafe aafekkazar, xaphor shodinttii, nam7i toke meleez mith garkke. <verse eid="JUD 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13"/>U eni7iza abba zulo garkk fa yeellas gappunttizita. Unttii medhinas linxxi geez dhuma naagiz daaburiza xoolinttita.<verse eid="JUD 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14"/>Addaamepp aykkii, laappuntha yeletithi maaqqeez Heenooke, yha asay baz tinbbite odittar, «Yeezako, Goday, fa gaame mukule geeshshitayir ye7oda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:18">Medhe. 5:18</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">21-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15"/>As ubba pirddoda; ubba u ootheez iita ootho ubbay gishonnee erttar u Xoossal odintteez iita oday ubbay gisho pirddoda» yeegeeza. <verse eid="JUD 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16"/>Ye asay ubba wode zigirizitannee oda koyizita. Ma fa iita amo kaalliza; paas ceeqqinttiza fana adiza baz denggodayis hara asita geshinttiza.<verse eid="JUD 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Naagisonnee zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17"/>Zin ta siiqitayyo, nu Goda Yesuusa Kiristtoosa hawaaritay tiin yinttis odeez qaala akaakoytta. <verse eid="JUD 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18"/>U, «wurssith wode, Xooss shenepp haakkii fa amo kaallii toochchizitay ye7oda» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:3">2 Phix. 3:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JUD 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19"/>Ye asay as gancce phalqqithi medhdhizita, fa asho amos moddinttizitannee geeshsha Ayyana baazita.<verse eid="JUD 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20"/>Zin ta ishuntho, geesh maaqqeez yi ammanattir dichchodayis mingoytta; ma geeshsha Ayyana wolqqar woossoytta. <verse eid="JUD 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21"/>Yinttan medhina yeziz yessiko helithod nu Goda Yesuusa Kiristtoosa maarotitha naagttar yinttan Xoossay siiqayir naagoytta.<verse eid="JUD 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22"/>Se77iza asayis qadhdhoytta. <verse eid="JUD 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23"/>Pettii pettii asa tamapp kessii ekkoytta. Ma yeypp iita amor tuneez u afila ixxittar hara asayis yashshar maaroytta.<verse eid="JUD 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galata woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24"/>Yi fokkaamay garkk oothodayisinnee boro baazita, ufayisar kumeezita uddii fa bonchcho tiina yinttan shiishodayis danda7iza, <verse eid="JUD 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25"/>nuna ashshiza pettii Xoossayis, nu Goda Yesuusa Kiristtoosa baggar bonchcho, deette, wolqqa, mawute, binikka, yhattekka, medhinasikka eesi maaqqo. Amin77ii.<verse eid="JUD 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1"/>
</usx>
